.861050','2026-09-01 16:21:56.861050'),('fd003806-79c0-4b0c-a911-a2f40d6d8da5',7,'plc-002','UC501 Round2 094228','Round 2',2,'ACTIVE','2026-09-04 01:42:28.129469','2026-09-04 01:42:28.129469'),('post-001',1,'plc-001','Sunset views at Batu Caves','Climbed the 272 steps in the late afternoon and caught a stunning sunset over the limestone cliffs. The golden light on the temple shrines is a photographer\'s dream.',44,'DELETED','2026-08-16 22:19:46.000000','2026-08-28 20:16:40.772782'),('post-002',1,'plc-002','Cliff Point Sunset Walk','Took the coastal trail at Cliff Point around 6pm. Quiet path, gentle breeze, and an unobstructed view of the horizon. Bring water and a light jacket for the way back.',60,'ACTIVE','2026-08-18 22:19:46.000000','2026-08-18 22:19:46.000000'),('post-003',2,'plc-003','Emerald Lake Trail EXCURSION-EDITED-BY-PLAYWRIGHT','Weekend hike around the turquoise lake. The trail is beginner friendly but gets muddy after rain. Saw monitor lizards near the boardwalk - keep your distance! Edited during Playwright runtime validation.',29,'ACTIVE','2026-08-19 22:19:46.000000','2026-09-04 12:27:36.370352'),('post-004',1,'plc-004','Petronas Towers at Night','The view from the KLCC park at night is incredible. The towers light up at 7pm and the fountain show runs every 30 minutes. Best photo spot is the bridge by the lake.',57,'ACTIVE','2026-08-22 22:19:46.000000','2026-08-22 22:19:46.000000'),('post-005',2,'plc-002','Cliff Point Photography Guide','A practical guide for photographers: arrive 45 minutes before sunset, use the east ridge for silhouettes, and a polarising filter helps a lot with the coastal haze.',22,'ACTIVE','2026-08-23 22:19:46.000000','2026-08-23 22:19:46.000000');
